  "summary": "The U.S. economy grew 2.1% SAAR in 1Q26 as a slowdown in consumer spending was offset by stronger business fixed investment. Consumer spending rose 0.5% while business fixed investment rose 10.6% as spending on equipment and IP products surged due to the AI buildout.",
